Column2:
Westman Shaving (the tallow based formula that was sold before the Nirvana base).


 NOTE: I also tried:
- a tube of Proraso cream;
- Arko;
- a. Phoenix Artisan Accoutrements;
- b. Stirling;
- c. Muhle hard soap.


Not so much tried:
- d. Zingari man (tallow base);
- GBS hard puck;
- e. Shannon's soaps.


Even a-e are great soaps.

